OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to review ferry deal
OL,4,Abefore new funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire County Council should
OL,7,Fexamine the contract for the Fleetwood
OL,8,Fto Knott End Ferry before agreeing to
OL,9,Fany further funding, the county
OL,10,Fcouncillor responsible for transport
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FSpeaking at a cabinet meeting,
OL,14,Fcouncillor Warren Goldsworthy was
OL,15,Fresponding after opposition leaders
OL,16,Fquestioned whether the authority should
OL,17,Fmeet a request for extra money to keep
OL,18,Fthe service running.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
