OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to review ferry deal
OL,4,Abefore new funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe county council is responsible for
OL,7,Fthe running costs but, under an
OL,8,Fagreement, has shared them with Wyre
OL,9,FCouncil, with each authority paying
OL,10,Fhalf.
OL,12,FGoldsworthy said the council had
OL,13,Falready agreed to contribute more than
OL,14,F#57,000 and it was "unreasonable" to
OL,15,Fexpect County Hall to pay double that
OL,16,Famount.
